      <activity id="5b862bcd-ffe8-5cc9-80ca-3300aab61678" activityNameId="df93faea-0d49-5a1e-a5b1-ca2f099524eb" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Door, outer, wood-aluminium, wooden frame, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Door, outer, wood-aluminium, wooden frame, at plant
The measures of the visible door leaf are 1m x 2m. The door (1-side) and frame (1-side and interior) are aluminium planked (0.002m thick sheet). 1m2 of visible wooden door (incl. wooden frame) weighs 50kg. The door and frame are opaquely painted. The bill of materials is based on data from door manufactures.\nTechnology: Industry data.\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Bauteile\nLocal subcategory: Türen\nUVEK 2022 source file:634_EcoSpold_Türen_v1.5_UVEK2021_v0.2_R_corr._X-Tür_total.xml\n\n
UUID: aaaeae53-2893-349d-b04d-6e09631b7a1b
Included are the materials used in an outer wooden door and wooden frame.  The door leaf and frame are aluminium planked and opaquely painted. Production losses, work materials, packaging materials, energy demand and the transport of the materials are also included.
Location: undefined
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_aaaeae53-2893-349d-b04d-6e09631b7a1b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
